  "question": {
    "text": "The radius of the circle touching the line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and intersecting <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> orthogonally is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "0k6cf",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "R7SkP",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jem66",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "w24sc",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
